                                                "sense_id": "beb7935e-e56f-38b8-85e5-879483f334d5",
                                                "text": "I would wish it to be done, for the sake of what is more important than my comfort, a habit of self-command in you, a consideration of what is your duty, an attention to propriety, an endeavour to avoid the suspicions of others, to save your health and credit, and restore your tranquillity."
